# Optional frontend-local overrides. Never put secrets here; this file only configures the Vite
# development server. The browser always calls relative `/api/...` URLs, so nothing in the built
# application needs a backend hostname.
#
# Copy to `frontend/.env.local` when you need one of these.

# Where the Vite dev server proxies /api. Defaults to http://127.0.0.1:$APP_PORT from the
# repository-root .env, which is the same port the unified server uses.
# SSAMS_API_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8000

# Optional development HTTPS so a phone on the LAN can reach the dev server with a trusted
# certificate (camera/geolocation require a secure context). Install/trust the issuing CA on the
# device first; never ship a self-signed certificate users cannot validate.
# SSAMS_DEV_TLS_KEY=C:\certs\ssams-dev-key.pem
# SSAMS_DEV_TLS_CERT=C:\certs\ssams-dev-cert.pem
